																		Where&#039;s the Beach?
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3075960); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3075960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609146364" alt="stormbreath" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3075960)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3075960); return false;" >stormbreath</a></span> <span class="odate time_1508117250 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">16 Oct 2017 01:27</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3614015">
									

<p>Once, when I was swimming, I got knocked down beneath the waves. When I came back up, I had somehow turned myself around without realizing and was looking out to the ocean. In the seconds before I wheeled around, I thought the beach was gone. This SCP is that panic.</p>
<p>This was an attempt to write an SCP based more on exploration logs than on the actual document itself. I hope that I wrote each of the characters well - each of the five in the article is supposed to have their own voice.</p>
<p>The title is a bad reference to the Wendy's &quot;Where's the beef?&quot; ads.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Spoilers</a></div>
