</ul>
<p>The picture is Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0 Unported, 2.5 Generic, 2.0 Generic and 1.0 Generic license, sourced from here: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bill_Baggs_SP_beach04.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bill_Baggs_SP_beach04.jpg</a></p>
