			<div class="content" id="post-content-3614030">
									

<p>While this is really well-written, there are two things that make me hesitant to upvote it.</p>
<p>1. The first exploration log feels a little too cliche, the final few lines especially are just kinda&#8230; cheesy and unnatural.</p>
<p>2. This feels a little too similar to 3008, except it's an ocean rather than an IKEA.</p>
<p>That being said, despite its similarities to existing skips and cliches in the dialogue, it's well-written, clinical, and not uninteresting enough to warrant a downvote.</p>

