			<div class="content" id="post-content-3614046">
									

<p>The ending for the first log was my least favorite, and I've decided to cut out everything after 8872 says that she's already in Hell until she says Help and drowns. Hopefully that makes it a little better.</p>
<p>I do see the similarities between this and 3008, but I think those similarities are less important to the actual SCP - they're both extradimensional places that take people from other realities, but this is quiet, boring and empty unlike the fear and crowds of 3008. The story in this is meant to come from the fact there's nothing in the ocean, which I thought was different from 3008.</p>

