<p><em>Waterworlds</em> wasn't <em>that</em> bad, was it?</p>
<p>Joking aside, this is effective in conveying the weirdness and extent of its effect. My only question is, why didn't they they try supplying someone with a diving tank to see if they could submerge themselves for longer than 30 seconds on the other side or something? Or is it reasonable to assume they tried but removed it for brevity if it failed?</p>
<p>Either way, it's really well written and engaging.</p>

